<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>List on INFINI Pizza</title><link>https://pizza.rs/tags/list/</link><description>Recent content in List on INFINI Pizza</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://pizza.rs/tags/list/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>List the cluster trash</title><link>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/list/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pizza.rs/docs/references/trash/list/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="list-the-cluster-trash">
 List the cluster trash
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#list-the-cluster-trash">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>List every node&amp;rsquo;s trash, merged into one cluster-wide, namespace-centric
view. The request may be sent to any node; the node that receives it
aggregates the trash of every cluster member.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="examples">
 Examples
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#examples">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /_cluster/trash
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>A typical item — here a deleted namespace held on two nodes:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;nodes_scanned&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;unreachable_nodes&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[],&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;retention_secs&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">86400&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;items&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;1788916375_namespace-website&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;deleted_at&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1788916375&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;bytes&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2097152&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;files&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">42&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;kind&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;namespace&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;namespace&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;website&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;collections&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;shard_groups&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">12&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;shard_copies&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">14&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;restorable&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;holders&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;node_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;…&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;node_name&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;pizza-1&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;bytes&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1048576&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;files&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">21&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">},&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;node_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;…&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;node_name&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;pizza-2&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;bytes&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1048576&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;files&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">21&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="request">
 Request
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#request">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">GET /_cluster/trash
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="response">
 Response
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#response">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>items&lt;/code> — newest first; each item merges every node that still holds a
copy of the data into &lt;code>holders&lt;/code>.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>kind&lt;/code> — &lt;code>namespace&lt;/code> or &lt;code>collection&lt;/code>, parsed from the delete-time
snapshot. Items without a snapshot (legacy items swept by the orphan
scanner before snapshots existed, or a failed snapshot write) report
&lt;code>restorable: false&lt;/code> and cannot be restored.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>retention_secs&lt;/code> — the effective retention; items are physically
deleted once older than this.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>unreachable_nodes&lt;/code> — members that could not be reached; the list may
be incomplete for items they hold.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item></channel></rss>